1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,477
You can get two figures and a drone in one minute.

2
00:00:03,477 --> 00:00:09,334
The first prerequisite is that there must be a drone in the team. Then we choose conventional nuclear power plants,

3
00:00:09,334 --> 00:00:14,275
Come to the middle of the two jars on the right side of the Bioprevention Equipment Research Institute. After entering through this hole,

4
00:00:14,275 --> 00:00:19,583
Come to a room on the right, then take out the drone and put it through the hole.

5
00:00:19,583 --> 00:00:24,708
It should be noted that this drone will break down if it falls into the water. There are a total of five chances.

6
00:00:24,708 --> 00:00:29,100
So if you don’t know how to jump, you can take a look at the anchor’s route.

7
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:43,886
After coming down, there is a password on the left. Then we go out to the room directly opposite and enter the password.

8
00:00:43,886 --> 00:00:55,900
After entering, there is a password room. The password is fixed, zero-ninety-one.

9
00:00:55,900 --> 00:01:01,941
After entering, go to the small right side, and there is a small room with a small suitcase containing a note.

10
00:01:01,941 --> 00:01:07,093
If you take this note out, you will get another figure. After taking this note,

11
00:01:07,093 --> 00:01:12,068
Carry the drone to the extraction point, and you will finally get two figures and a drone.

12
00:01:12,068 --> 00:01:16,510
It should be noted that the drone strap is a shared note and only counts as personal.
